==English==

===Etymology===
{{wikipedia}}

Mistranslation of "君達の基地は、全てCATSがいただいた" (in original context: "we (CATS) have taken all of your bases").

This grammatically incorrect "[[Engrish]]" phrase originated in the English subtitles to the 1991 European [[w:Sega Mega Drive|Sega Mega Drive]] version of the 1989 Japanese arcade game ''[[w:Zero Wing|Zero Wing]]'' and became a [[catch phrase]]/[[meme]] on the [[Internet]] in the early 2000s.

